From: Alexander Koval <kovalidis@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:47:21 +0200
Subject: Install ntp

The board has no battery-backed clock and boots at 1970, so WireGuard
handshakes are rejected as replays. Sync the time with ntpd at boot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig b/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
index d08225ec..804d1281 100644
--- a/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
+++ b/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_NANOCOM=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_NFTABLES=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_NFTABLES_PYTHON is not set
 BR2_PACKAGE_NMAP=y
+BR2_PACKAGE_NTP=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSH=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSH_GEN_KEYS=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_PCRE2_16=y
